          "type": "mc",
          "difficulty": "hard",
          "stem": "A telescope mirror mounting rail has a measured length of \\\\(4\\\\text{ metres}\\) and \\\\(6\\\\text{ centimetres}\\\\). Express this length in metres as a decimal.",
