          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Identify the measurements and the conversion factor. The length is \\\\(4\\\\text{ m}\\) and \\\\(6\\\\text{ cm}\\\\), and we know that \\\\(100\\\\text{ cm} = 1\\\\text{ m}\\\\).",
